            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "This project explores the dilemmas of identity politics through Frank Chin's terminology of \"racist love.\" Through an interactive art installation, the author explores questions of identity, belonging, community, and race-making in skateboarding culture as an Asian American.",
